    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Round buckler with a domed steel boss carrying a punched sun motif, three concentric brass rings, a rivet row and a rolled brass rim. The bottom view confirms a real leather-lined grip bar with metal loops on the reverse, so it can actually be held or strapped to a forearm. Free-standing with no display furniture. Unrigged static prop.",
    "limitations": [
      "Stylised Cozy-kit palette rather than photoreal materials.",
      "The grip is fused to the shell.",
      "No arm straps are modelled, only the central grip."
    ],
